# P1 and P2 swept fast across their whole range (and back) during a 16th pattern at 180 BPM on perc, and jumped
# 0 <-> 255 every step on sample (the knob moves that crashed macro v3): every hit reads the knobs at its start.
tempo 180
steps 64
tail 12.0
track perc
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 32
sweep p1 0 255 32 48
sweep p1 255 0 48 64
sweep p2 0 255 0 24
sweep p2 255 0 24 48
sweep p2 0 255 48 64
note 0 F3 1 100
note 1 Gb3 1 100
note 2 A3 1 100
note 3 F3 1 100
note 4 Eb4 1 100
note 5 E4 1 100
